								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "##Starting From GtToolit <--- This is perferred\n1. Create new Package via the Coder (Ex: Lcs-ExperimentalPackage)\n2. Open  Git Repository Browser \n\t2.1 Go to the 'Packages' tab\n\t2.2 Click on the new package button (+) \n\t2.3 . Search for the new package name and add it\n3. In the BaselineOf...repository.... add the code to load the package."
						},
