							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "##Starting From Git Hub\n1) In GItHub add new directory and a temp.txt file\n\t\t\tex: /src/Lcs-InternalOrganization/temp.txt\n2) In GitHub BaselineOF file add a line to load the directory in as a package in GToolkit.\n3) In the target repository, (ex: lcs-base), add the new package to the repository"
